---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Careers | JayTech9"
  description="Work at JayTech9. See open roles in support, engineering, design and data, or send your CV for future vacancies."
>
  <header class="page-head careers-head">
    <img
      class="careers-head__art"
      src="/images/careers-tech.webp"
      width="736"
      height="630"
      alt=""
      loading="eager"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 class="visually-hidden">Careers</h1>
      <p class="lede careers-intro">
        <span class="careers-intro__big">JayTech9 is <em>growing.</em></span>
        As we take on more clients, we’ll be adding
        <strong>support agents, developers, designers</strong> and more.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="section openings-section" aria-labelledby="openings-heading">
    <div class="wrap overlap sheet careers-sheet">
      <div class="careers-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="careers-circle"></span>
      </div>
      <img
        class="careers-person"
        src="/images/careers-person-400.webp"
        srcset="/images/careers-person-400.webp 400w, /images/careers-person-674.webp 674w"
        sizes="(width >= 48rem) 21rem, 9rem"
        width="400"
        height="595"
        alt=""
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <h2 id="openings-heading">Open roles</h2>
      <div class="card empty">
        <span class="icon-badge">
          <svg
            class="icon"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            aria-hidden="true"
            focusable="false"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16" />
            <rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="empty__title">Currently, there is no open vacancy.</p>
        <p>We’re always glad to hear from talented people. Send your CV and we’ll keep it on file for future roles.</p>
        <div class="button-row empty__actions">
          <a class="button" href="mailto:info@jaytech9.com?subject=Future%20roles%20at%20JayTech9">Send your CV</a>
          <a class="button button--quiet" href="/about/">About JayTech9</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--band" aria-labelledby="teams-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="teams-heading">Teams we’re building</h2>
      <ul class="card-grid teams">
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M3 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5Zm0 0a9 9 0 1 1 18 0m0 0v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3Z" />
              <path d="M21 16v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-5" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Customer Support</h3>
          <p>
            The first voice our clients hear. Answering questions, solving problems and making sure nothing
            falls through the cracks.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="m16 18 6-6-6-6" />
              <path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Engineering</h3>
          <p>Building and maintaining websites, business systems and our own products.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="m18 13-.654-4.736a4 4 0 00-2.756-3.266l-9.163-2.9a2 2 0 00-2.017.493l-.82.819a2 2 0 00-.492 2.017l2.9 9.163a4 4 0 003.266 2.756L13 18" />
              <path d="M18.648 12.352a1.205 1.205 0 011.704 0l1.296 1.296a1.205 1.205 0 010 1.704l-6.296 6.296a1.205 1.205 0 01-1.704 0l-1.296-1.296a1.205 1.205 0 010-1.704z" />
              <path d="m3 3 6.586 6.586" />
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="2" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Design</h3>
          <p>Brand, interface and print design for clients and for JayTech9.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M14 9.536V7a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h1.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5V5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4 4 4 0 0 0-4 4c0 2 1 3 1 5a5 5 0 0 1-1 3" />
              <path d="M4 9a5 5 0 0 1 8 4 5 5 0 0 1-8-4" />
              <path d="M5 21h14" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Data &amp; AgriTech</h3>
          <p>Field data, dashboards and analysis, including our work with smallholder farmers.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .openings-section h2,
  .section--band h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .empty {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  .empty__actions {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  /* Header picture: a hand on a tablet with floating icons, faded into the blue on every side so
     it reads as part of the header. Sits behind the text and behind his head. */
  .careers-head {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .careers-head > .wrap {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .careers-head__art {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: max(0px, calc((100% - var(--wrap, 75rem)) / 2 - 6rem));
    height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 60%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: left center;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.95;
    -webkit-mask-image:
      linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, #000 30%, #000 80%, transparent 100%),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, #000 20%, #000 70%, transparent 100%);
    -webkit-mask-composite: source-in;
    mask-image:
      linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, #000 30%, #000 80%, transparent 100%),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, #000 20%, #000 70%, transparent 100%);
    mask-composite: intersect;
  }
  @media (width < 48rem) {
    .careers-head__art {
      max-width: none;
      height: 70%;
      right: -3rem;
      opacity: 0.12;
    }
    .careers-head .lede {
      color: var(--white);
    }
  }
  /* Phones: his head rises above the card, so the header text needs room above it. */
  @media (width < 48rem) {
    .page-head {
      padding-bottom: calc(var(--overlap) + 5.5rem);
    }
  }
  /* Illustration: he stands on the right of the card holding his laptop towards the content, in
     front of a soft blue circle clipped to the card; his head rises above the card into the header.
     The picture is cropped at the waist, so that edge always sits on the card's bottom edge (laptop)
     or behind the vacancy card (phone). Sizes are fractions of the picture width (--pw). */
  .careers-sheet {
    --pw: 9rem;
    --pr: clamp(0.5rem, 3vw, 1.25rem);
    --pt: -3.75rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .careers-sheet > :not(.careers-visual, .careers-person) {
    z-index: 2;
    position: relative;
  }
  .careers-visual {
    pointer-events: none;
    border-radius: inherit;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .careers-circle {
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: calc(var(--pw) * 1.08);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 35%, #2a8fd0 0%, #0068a1 55%, #00507c 100%);
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(var(--pt) + var(--pw) * 0.42);
    right: calc(var(--pr) - var(--pw) * 0.02);
  }
  .careers-circle:after {
    content: '';
    border: 1.5px dashed #ffffff80;
    border-radius: 50%;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 7%;
  }
  .careers-person {
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    width: var(--pw);
    height: auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 18px #10293a33);
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--pt);
    right: var(--pr);
  }
  .careers-sheet > h2 {
    padding-right: calc(var(--pw) + 0.5rem);
  }
  /* Phones: the vacancy card covers his waist, hiding where the picture is cropped. */
  .careers-sheet .empty {
    margin-top: 3.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 -10px 24px -12px #10293a40;
  }
  @media (width>=48rem) {
    .careers-sheet {
      /* Taller than the card so his head and shoulders rise above its top edge. */
      --pw: clamp(19rem, 14rem + 9vw, 21rem);
      --pr: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
      padding-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    }
    .careers-person {
      top: auto;
      bottom: 0;
    }
    .careers-circle {
      top: auto;
      bottom: calc(var(--pw) * -0.18);
    }
    .careers-sheet > h2 {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
    .careers-sheet .empty {
      margin-top: 0;
      box-shadow: none;
      max-width: min(44rem, calc(100% - var(--pw) - 4rem));
    }
  }
  .empty__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .job__main p {
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }
  .job__meta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    display: grid;
  }
  .job__meta dt {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .job__meta dd {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  /* Header intro: a bold first line, with the key words in the site's light green. */
  .careers-intro {
    max-width: 34rem;
    color: #e3eff6;
  }
  .careers-intro__big {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 2.4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .careers-intro em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: #9be870;
  }
  .careers-intro strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #9be870;
  }
</style>
